    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><em>護甲（盾牌），非普通（需同調）</em><br />你可以用這面魔法盾牌發動遠程武器攻擊。它具有20尺的通常射程與60尺的最大射程，且它的攻擊檢定使用你的力量屬性或敏捷屬性（由你選擇）。如果你具有盾牌的熟練項，那麼你也將熟練於用這面盾牌發起的攻擊檢定。命中時，它將造成[[/damage 1d6 type=slashing]]傷害。如果你投擲了盾牌，不論攻擊是否命中，它都會在攻擊後立刻重新飛回你的手上。</p><p>You can make a ranged weapon attack with this magic shield. It has a normal range of 20 feet and a long range of 60 feet, and it uses your Strength or Dexterity for the attack roll (your choice). If you're proficient with shields, you are proficient with attacks made using this shield. On a hit, it deals [[/damage 1d6 type=slashing]] damage. If you throw the shield, it reappears in your hand the instant after it hits or misses a target.</p></div>",
